      "expected": "For the LTC4412 USB-to-+5V ideal-diode path, the P-channel MOSFET should have its source on the input side (USBC_VBUS_IN) and drain on the output side (+5V), so the controller can block reverse current.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "+5V ... Q1.2(S,passive)"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "USBC_VBUS_IN ... Q1.3(D,passive) ... U6.1(VIN,power_in)"
        },
        {
